WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.800
The real window, with a stand-in engine and example models: the figures are placeholders.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.800
In Models, every model shows an estimated speed range, before any download.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.300
It is a wide range from your memory size and drive speed. It is not a measurement.

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:27.400
Choose a model: the download size and the folder are shown first.

5
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:33.400
Tick the licence box, then press Download and install.

6
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:44.400
Pause, or even close the window: the download keeps going in the background.

